WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.070
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.190
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.780
As the battle between IGO and 
Gourmet Corp. intensified,

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.850
the duel between Toriko and 
Starjun became extremely fierce.

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:20.240
Toriko increased the force of his techniques 
by focusing on images of winning.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:26.020
But Starjun surpassed Toriko 
with his unlimited strength.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:35.680
The Greatest Enemy in 
History! "Joie" Appears!

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:41.580
It's about time for you to attack, you say?

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.780
I don't know if that's 
a flaming sword or what,

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.070
but come on!

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.880
Try an' get a piece of me!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.150
This isn't a sword.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.330
It's a Burner Knife.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:03:00.800
It's a knife used for Special Preparation 
Ingredients which grills as it cuts.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:06.300
Although I didn't expect 
to be using it here...

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.130
I'm gonna take that as a compliment.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:15.910
Picture it...

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.610
Attacking, defending, everything...

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:21.610
...will go the way I imagine it!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.890
The ground melted!

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.550
What do you think of my image?

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:42.600
Though it does seem to be a very different 
image than what you had in mind.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.820
Ultimate Routine, eh?

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:49.120
I can put that to good use.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.680
It's a nice technique.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.500
Don't tell me...

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.580
...he made the technique his own?!

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.650
Interesting!

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.220
These Knives and Forks are 
attuned to my sense of smell!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.120
You can't avoid 'em!

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.160
It's no use!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:12.060
All of 'em detect your scent 
and will keep goin' after you!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.920
Flame Twister, Blazing Whirlwind!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.410
The lighthouse don't shine on its base!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.430
You ain't got enough flames here!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.140
Our battle

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:30.180
should be hotter,

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.750
with even our feet lit up!

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.290
50-fold Fork Shield!

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.560
60-fold Knife Nail Gun!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.180
Star!!

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.550
Toriko!!

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.630
Gourmet Corp. and IGO...

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.890
Both have been hit hard.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.510
Gourmet Corp. has hit its limit too.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.990
Just as we members of NEO planned...

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.480
I expect it'll end any time now.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.930
Toriko-san is fighting in that fire!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:49.330
With feelings even hotter than those flames!

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:52.530
Campfire Fierce Blaze!

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.600
Fork Armor!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.210
Twin Nail Gun!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.010
Burner Crisp Skewer!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.720
Leg Nail Kick!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.310
Those images, headed straight for my life,

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.270
were full of serious spirit.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.250
If a normal human

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:44.480
suffers third-degree burns 
over 10% of their body,

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.890
it's often fatal.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:51.990
But even after fighting in 
the flames all this time,

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:56.410
it seems your cells are 
dividing at a dizzying pace

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.580
and new skin is being produced

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.640
at an extraordinary speed.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:05.790
I'm also sweatin' like crazy

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.750
to keep my temperature down,

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.370
but it's costin' me a lotta energy!

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:15.810
Even though Ultimate Routine alone

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.650
consumes tons of calories...

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.170
Sure, I just about gorged myself 
to death on food before comin',

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.770
but how long can Food's End hold out?!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.890
Still...

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:31.060
I ain't got time to think about it!

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:43.890
Hang in there,

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:47.410
Toriko-san!!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:50.050
Leg 50-fold Knife!

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.330
Single Stroke Searing Sever!

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:02.760
Twin Nail Gun!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.370
60-fold Knife Nail Gun!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:12.470
70-fold Fork Spiked Punch!

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.360
Burner Punch!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:28.420
70-fold Nail Spiked Punch!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.120
Fire Spear!

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.460
Toriko-san!

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.690
Leg 50-fold Fork!

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.060
Fire Shield! Bone Fry!

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.860
50-fold Twin Nail Gun!

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.260
Burner Shot!

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.680
We keep coming up with more 
and more new techniques, huh?

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.280
This is...

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.790
...also exactly as I imagined it...

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:13.420
Well...

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.590
Let's make sure.

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:22.330
Whose image will end this, yours or mine?

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.480
<i>He's</i> here...

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:50.900
This brings back memories.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:57.090
I haven't been to the Fest in 200 years.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.110
That's...

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.110
Life force is savory.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.080
Thoughts are flavor.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.450
Tasting Scope.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.850
I see.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:31.330
There are still many strong, 
savory tastes left.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.930
But the flavor isn't good.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.470
Shall I change them,

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.470
as I did yours?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.380
It seems he's here.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:01.170
But why would he go to the trouble of 
showing himself in public like this?

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.430
He probably came to say 
farewell to the Human World.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.870
T-Three members of G7...

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:13.000
All of you should prepare to depart as well.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:16.140
With this, I think the battle is now over.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:30.910
You three can leave.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.760
After all, you wouldn't have beaten her.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.300
W-Why are you...?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.130
Teppei!

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:46.300
My sharp ears...

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.450
...heard everything!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:54.180
One thing's for sure, you're cocky as hell!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.150
Both of ya...

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:03.450
Voice Missile!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.460
Sound Insulation Tree.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.430
Earthquake Resistant Root.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:28.390
He's no longer the Teppei 
that you people knew.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:32.770
Through my cooking, his flavor has changed.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.490
Now he's a completely different human.

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:39.990
What?!

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.600
Nitro?

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:50.200
Their feral instincts have 
sensed that I'm dangerous

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.840
and so they attack.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.710
That knife...

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.450
Taste Change.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.150
They're easy to cook with,

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:12.460
these Red Nitro.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:17.960
Although it seems they were 
originally under someone's control?

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.000
J-Joie...

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.800
Where did you...

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:26.490
Where did you get that knife?!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.860
Setsuno...

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.850
It's been a long time, hasn't it?

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:38.090
Now, there are only a handful of people 
left who know about me, including you.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.850
But I advise you to pry no further.

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.420
You'll die too, otherwise.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:49.370
This knife?

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.730
It's mine. What about it?

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:56.130
Don't play dumb!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.400
I'm going to unmask you,

00:15:58.890 --> 00:15:59.890
Joie!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.430
That knife...

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:06.650
...is the legendary Cinderella!

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:11.380
Long ago, it was used by Froese-sama,

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:15.480
known as the God Chef!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.340
Yes...

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:24.920
That's why it's mine.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:28.100
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:37.010
Uh-oh...

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.340
Everyone, get back!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.980
10 Million Slice Fillet.

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.450
Flavor Flow!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.220
E-Even the sea...

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.570
...has been filleted?

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.390
Could that be...

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:12.110
...the one-of-a-kind Takitsuba,

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.580
Setsuno-sama's personal knife?

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:18.250
This is the first time I've seen it in use.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:20.350
Setsuno-sama is serious too!

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:24.830
You blocked one of my techniques?

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:30.400
I thought only Acacia's three disciples 
were capable of such a feat.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.310
Nonsense!

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.970
I didn't... deflect it completely...

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.370
Setsuno-sama!

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.880
What the hell is goin' on?!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.470
We have to return to the Stadium...

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.700
You sense it too, don't you?

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:07.070
Unfortunately, we'll have 
to set aside our fight.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:18.860
Why did you show up now?

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:22.810
There's a certain chef with whom 
I would like to have a word.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.480
And yet you toss off destructive 
attacks like that?!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:32.460
I just hope your target wasn't 
killed in that last one.

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:36.790
It seems my person of interest 
is no longer in this stadium.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:43.200
Besides, I select and isolate 
my targets, of course.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:45.470
For example...

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:49.870
Freshness UP Revitalizing Cut!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:51.910
The Dark Art!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.030
The Nitro that I took down...

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.880
...came back to life!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.300
And on top of that,

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.630
they're way stronger than before.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:21.510
I can tell you're a heavy 
user of the Dark Art.

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:26.300
Now, finish this by devouring her.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.070
Setsuno-sama!

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:32.450
Get back!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.650
You guys don't have a chance!

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:37.420
Binding Tree!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.160
Teppei!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:00.770
What's this?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.410
Well, well...

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:09.400
Knocking Master Jiro.

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:13.250
Sheesh.

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:16.260
What a pain...

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:32.380
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:37.880
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:43.300
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:48.620
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:54.400
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:20:54.400 --> 00:21:00.100
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:06.260
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:11.380
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.980
Mega Raba

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:15.820
Mega Raba

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:18.740
Mega Raba

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:26.600
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.270
Guess the Legend!

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:26.300
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.440
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:32.360
This is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.270
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:44.580
Really?! Level 8

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.670
Today's "Really?!" level is 8.

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:44.970
Someone once said...

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:48.030
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:50.520
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:54.220
Someone once said...

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:58.530
There is an edible mountain pass made 
of your favorite delicious side dishes

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:02.920
that you can fill up on whenever you like...

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.720
Something something!

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:07.680
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.760
Start!

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:12.900
That sounds delicious!

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:16.660
You can make a picnic out 
of this mountain pass.

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:17.960
When you think of a picnic...

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.600
Bento?

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:23.390
Someone once said...

00:22:23.390 --> 00:22:26.900
There is an edible mountain pass made 
of your favorite delicious side dishes

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:31.450
that you can fill up on whenever you like...

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:36.030
Mountbento Pass!

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:39.820
I'll go on location at Mountbento 
Pass today and do a story!

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:43.740
And now, our next segment!
